      "signature": "schedule enum[168]",
      "description": "The schedule array represent the list of week hours timeslot, starting on monday a midnight. Therefore the complete week is represented in a array of 168 elements (24 * 7) Each slot can have the following value: Type Description normal downloads will use normal DlRate config for this timeslot slow downloads will use slow DlRate config for this timeslot hibernate downloads will be paused for this timeslot",
